{"code":"279570","name":"케이뱅크","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"은행","sector_desc":"예대마진 기반 금융. 금리 수준과 대손비용, 주주환원 정책(배당·자사주)이 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2016년 설립, 같은 해 은행업 인가를 획득하고 2017년 대고객 영업을 시작한 국내 1호 인터넷전문은행임. 예적금, 생활통장 등 수신 상품과 비대면 신용대출, 주택담보대출 등 여신 상품을 제공하며, 업비트 실명인증, 증권연계계좌 등을 운영하고 있음. Open Ecosystem 전략을 통해 통신, 투자, 디지털자산 제휴 서비스를 확대, 디지털 금융 플랫폼으로 진화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-11-27","n_days":182,"close":5210.0,"open":5110.0,"high":5230.0,"low":5100.0,"volume":275649,"amount":1428317200.0,"ret_1d":2.1569,"gap":0.1961,"range_pct":2.4952,"ret_5":-2.4345,"ret_20":2.3576,"ret_60":-8.7566,"ret_120":-6.7979,"ret_250":null,"ma20":5230.0,"ma60":5342.6667,"ma120":5595.4167,"ma200":null,"close_vs_ma200":null,"close_vs_ma60":-2.4832,"ma_align":0,"ma50":5276.6,"ma150":5648.5333,"ma200_chg_21":null,"cross_ma200_20d":null,"slope_60":-32.2968,"r2_60":0.5251,"slope_120":-31.9094,"r2_120":0.5497,"slope_250":null,"r2_250":null,"high52":9880.0,"low52":5010.0,"pos_52w":4.1068,"dd_52w":-47.2672,"from_low52":3.992,"mdd_1y":-39.0156,"atr14_pct":3.0436,"vol_ann_60":23.9565,"stop_atr2_pct":6.0872,"vol_avg20":442387.75,"vol_ratio20":0.6231,"vr5":0.7439,"vr20":0.2137,"amount_avg5":1856834271.0,"amount_avg20":2322727775.0,"amount_avg60":2548498004.25,"obv_chg20":15.623,"turnover_20":2.1809,"pv_eff_20":1.081,"rsi14":48.3119,"frgn_net_5":-127315.0,"inst_net_5":100913.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0314,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0249,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0065,"frgn_net_20":1472842.0,"inst_net_20":497698.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.363,"inst_net_20_pct":0.1227,"smart_net_20_pct":0.4857,"frgn_net_60":1745509.0,"inst_net_60":615382.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.4303,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1517,"smart_net_60_pct":0.5819,"frgn_net_120":8716384.0,"inst_net_120":14186691.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":2.1485,"inst_net_120_pct":3.4969,"smart_net_120_pct":5.6454,"foreign_ratio":2.39,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.59,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":270.0,"op_margin_q":8.267,"op_qoq":-16.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-61.3181,"rev_yoy":-7.5573,"op_trend